tip Jandia stands next to Rau Cliffrunner.

# North and east: the Galak centaur, Splithoof Hold, Dorn Plainstalker, the kobolds, the egg ---------

do 4841 bg
tip The Galak camps spread over the plain north of Freewind Post and around Splithoof Crag. Scouts are the fewest: kill every one you see.
goto "Enter Splithoof Crag, the centaurs' cave, and follow it up into Splithoof Hold" at 44.1,37.3 r 10
do 1197
tip The Ancient Brazier stands at the back of Splithoof Hold, guarded by two level 30 centaurs: pull them away from it one at a time. Then each of you uses the Filled Etched Phial on the brazier to douse its flame and takes the Cloven Hoof from it.
do 4841
tip Finish the centaur around the cave mouth and the camps east of it, on your way to Dorn.
accept 1149
tip Dorn Plainstalker waits in a small cave in the cliffs north-east of Freewind Post.
do 1149 at 53.9,41.5 icon talk "Talk to Dorn again to be taken to the planks above the canyon, then walk off their end"
tip Up there, wait until the speech is over, then step off the end of the planks. You never hit the ground: you are brought back to Dorn.
turnin 1149
accept 1150
do 1153
tip The Gravelsnout Diggers and Surveyors dig just south of Dorn's cave and on along the cliffs to the east. About every other one drops a sample; each of you needs one. Stormheart, an elite of level 30, roams the plain east of Freewind Post: fight it together or let it pass.
do 4821 at 56.4,50.4
tip The egg lies in one of three serpent dens at the foot of the cliffs: east of the kobolds (56.4,50.4), south-east of Freewind Post (52.3,55.3) or south-west of it (37.6,56.1). Look in the two east ones first. Serpents guard it.

