# West: the Roguefeather Den, Highperch, Steelsnap, Whitereach Post, the Boiling Pool ---------------

do 98069 bg
do 98070 bg
tip The Screeching Canyon is west of Freewind Post: the harpies live at the foot of its cliffs and in a cave at the top (the Roguefeather Den). Windcallers knock everyone near them back and stun: fight them away from the others. The sacks lie on the ground all over the den.
do 1150
tip Climb to the cave at the top and go to its deepest room. Click the Harpy Foodstuffs there to spoil them: the harpies rush you, then Grenka Bloodscreech comes. Clear the room first, and keep one of you ready for her.
do 98070
do 98069
do 4767 bg
tip The Highperch wyverns guard their eggs: pick them up wherever you see them, on the lower ledges and up on the plateau.
accept 4770
tip Highperch is the plateau in the far west: follow the canyon wall north-west from the harpies to the ramp that climbs into it. Pao'ka Swiftmountain hides halfway up. Both of you accept before either starts the escort. Watch for Heartrazor, a rare elite wyvern of level 32 that flies about.
do 4770 at 15.2,32.7
tip Wyverns swoop on her along the way, and three more come at the end: let her tank, kill them before they turn on you.
do 4767
tip The rest of the eggs lie on the top of Highperch, at its western edge.
do 1131
tip Steelsnap is a big hyena that roams the north-west of the canyon, between Highperch and the northern cliffs, with two hyenas at his side. Kill the guards first. He comes back within five minutes.
accept 4881 at 19.0,26.4 icon kill mobs 10617 "Kill the Galak Messenger, loot his Assassination Note and open it: it starts a quest"
tip He walks the road between the Galak camps and the north-west corner of the canyon, past Whitereach Post. Not in sight? Wait by the road: he comes back within five minutes.
route off
turnin 4865
tip Motega Firemane stands in Whitereach Post, the small camp by the road.
accept 5062
turnin 4770
accept 5151
tip Wizlo Bearingshiner stands in the post too. His panther is for the last loop: keep the key.
turnin 4881
tip Kanati Greycloud is next to Motega Firemane.
accept 4966
do 4966 mobs 10720
tip Three Galak Assassins rush in as soon as Kanati hears the warning: keep them off him and kill them. If they come for each of you, one after the other, take them on together both times.
turnin 4966
route on
do 5062
tip The Incendia Agave grows around the Boiling Pool, north-east of Whitereach Post, some of it under the water. The Boiling and Scalding Elementals there burn hard: pull them out of the plants. Watch out for level 38 elites that may roam between the pool and Freewind Post (Ailgrha Splittusk, the Ravaging Tempest and its elementals): keep well away from them.
hearth npc 6746

