# Darkcloud Pinnacle, Rok'Alim, the panther, Whitereach Post -----------------------------------------

goto "Climb onto Darkcloud Pinnacle from its south-west foot" at 31.5,36.7 r 10
tip The Grimtotem are tauren of level 28-30, often two or three together, with casters among them.
do 5064.1
tip Secret Note #1: the chest out in the open on top of the pinnacle.
do 5064.2
tip Secret Note #2: the chest inside the big tent.
do 5064.3
tip Secret Note #3: the chest inside the tent on the eastern plateau.
do 5088.1
tip The sacred fire of life burns on the needle where the Grimtotem bury their dead, north of the eastern plateau. Clear the guards around it, then each of you throws your Incendia Powder on it. Arikara, an elite serpent of level 28, comes out of it: fight her together.
do 5088.2
do 5147
tip Arnak Grimtotem stands at the northern end of the pinnacle, near his captive Lakota.
accept 4904
tip Both of you accept before Lakota sets off.
do 4904 at 30.9,37.1
tip She walks down off the pinnacle to the south-west. A pair of Grimtotem jumps out at every turn of the path: stay close and kill them fast.
do 1151
tip Rok'Alim the Pounder is a rock elemental, an elite of level 30, who walks a long loop through the west of the canyon below Highperch. He hits hard but slowly: fight him together.
do 5151
tip The wrecked caravan is just north of Whitereach Post. Open the cage with Wizlo's key: the Enraged Panther inside is an elite of level 30. Rest before you open it.
turnin 5088
turnin 5151
hearth npc 11116
tip Hearthstone not ready? Ride east along the road: Freewind Post is about four minutes away.

