# The Shimmering Flats and Gadgetzan ---------------------------------------------------------------

grind 30 at 63.5,59.0
tip Kravel Koalbeard has his errand only for level 30. Not there yet? Kill the hyenas on the way east to the Shimmering Flats. Stay clear of the silithid and Qiraji at the western edge of the flats: they are level 40 and more.
accept 1111
tip Ride east, down onto the Shimmering Flats: Kravel stands in the camp of the Mirage Raceway, in the south of the flats.
map Tanaris
goto "Ride south out of the Shimmering Flats along the road to Gadgetzan" at 51.5,26.0 r 20
tip Stay on the road: the beasts of Tanaris are level 40 and over.
fpath 7824

